blocks.en:
Table 1: Face-only reconstruction on synthetic FLAME subsets and the RenderMe360 [ 9 ] dataset. Results are averaged over all five camera views after rigid ICP alignment.
CD-L1 is reported in millimeters. Best results are in bold. Δ \Delta denotes ViGA-FLAME Param. minus the strongest baseline for each metric;
negative CD-L1 and positive F@5 indicate improvements.

blocks.zh:
表1:合成FLAME子集和RenderMe360[9]数据集上只面重建. 在严格调整比较方案后,所有5个相机的观测结果均值。
CD-L1报告为毫米. 最佳结果用黑体表示。 \Delta表示维加-FLAME Param。 减去每一度量的最强基线;
负CD-L1和正F@5表示改进。

